{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54842","headline":"兵要望江南 占蛇第十九（京本列第二十一○十二首） 一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占蛇第十九（京本列第二十一○十二首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵发日，路上遇横蛇。\n或入水中应大胜，蛇还赤地（京本作「色」）战无涯，胜负较些些（辛本、川本作「胜地住些些」。\n泊住过一日，外动则吉。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}